 "slug": "hladajte-na-hradiskach-poklady",
 "data": {
  "title": "Hunt for treasure at the hillforts – legally, with geocaching",
  "slug": "hunt-for-treasure-at-hillforts-geocaching",
  "excerpt": "Treasure hunting at hillforts usually brings to mind looters with metal detectors, yet at Slovak hillforts treasure can also be sought legally – and adventurously. All you need is a mobile phone or a GPS device, and here is a list of the most interesting caches already hidden at our hillforts.",
  "metaTitle": "Hunt for treasure at the hillforts – legally, with GPS",
  "metaDescription": "At Slovak hillforts, treasure can be hunted legally and adventurously with a mobile phone or GPS. A list of the most interesting geocaches at our hillforts.",
  "keyFacts": [],
  "timeline": [],
  "quotes": [],
  "mediaTexts": [
   {
    "mediaId": 5063,
    "alt": "A geocache container shaped like a tree stump, hidden in moss under pine needles"
   }
  ],
  "blocks": [
   {
    "__component": "content.rich-text",
    "body": [
     {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
       {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "When treasure hunting at hillforts is mentioned, most people think of looters plundering our cultural heritage with metal detectors."
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "__component": "content.rich-text",
    "body": [
     {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
       {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Hardly anyone knows, however, that at Slovak hillforts treasure can also be hunted in a legal and at the same time highly adventurous way. All you need is to have a mobile phone or a GPS device with you, to be registered on the geocaching website ("
       },
       {
        "type": "link",
        "url": "http://www.geocaching.com/",
        "children": [
         {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "www.geocaching.com"
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "), and then, following the coordinates and the description given on that site, you can discover hidden caches. These are mostly small boxes with various contents. In this way you can make a visit to the hillforts more enjoyable not only for yourself, but also for your offspring, who are sometimes not greatly thrilled by the remains of a timber-and-earth fortification somewhere deep in the woods. Besides the various small “treasures” that can be found in the caches, you will often also discover valuable information about the particular hillfort there. "
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "__component": "content.rich-text",
    "body": [
     {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
       {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "In cooperation with several experienced cachers we therefore bring you a list of the most interesting caches that are already placed at our hillforts and are waiting to be found. If you are a newcomer to geocaching, then before your first treasure hunt read these "
       },
       {
        "type": "link",
        "url": "https://ceskygeocaching.wordpress.com/pruvodce-zacatecnika/",
        "children": [
         {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "rules that have to be observed."
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
